    <h2>About AutoHub Used Cars</h2>

    <p>AutoHub is a family-owned used-car dealership founded in 2009. We specialize in carefully inspected, high-quality pre-owned vehicles at fair prices. Our mission is to make car buying simple, transparent and trustworthy.</p>

    <h3>What we do</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Hand-picked, inspected used cars with full service history (when available).</li>
        <li>Transparent pricing and a 7-day return policy for peace of mind.</li>
        <li>Flexible trade-in and financing options to fit your budget.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Why customers choose AutoHub</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Thorough inspections by certified technicians before every sale.</li>
        <li>Detailed vehicle reports and clear pricing — no hidden fees.</li>
        <li>Friendly, no-pressure buying experience with knowledgeable staff.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Our Promise</h3>
    <p>Every car at AutoHub goes through a 120-point inspection and is backed by a limited warranty. If you find a major problem within 7 days, return it — no questions asked (terms apply).</p>

    <h3>Location & Opening Hours</h3>
    <p>
        AutoHub Used Cars<br />
        123 Wheel Lane, Motor City<br />
        Open: Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00, Sat 10:00–16:00, Sun Closed
    </p>

